              d: "函数取极值的判据是导数为零，所以要求 $\\dfrac{dS}{d\\epsilon}\\Big|_{\\epsilon = 0} = 0$。把导数搬进积分号里，对 $L$ 用链式法则（意思是「外层对内层求导、再乘内层对 $\\epsilon$ 的导数」）：$\\dfrac{dS}{d\\epsilon} = \\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\left(\\dfrac{\\partial L}{\\partial q}\\eta + \\dfrac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\dot{q}}\\dot{\\eta}\\right)dt$。令它等于零，就得到 $\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\left(\\dfrac{\\partial L}{\\partial q}\\eta + \\dfrac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\dot{q}}\\dot{\\eta}\\right)dt = 0$。"
